    "detailed_description": "MATTY:<br>You play as Matty, the French bulldog, who lives in a place called Soup Town in Tartu, Estonia.<br>You have to find the stolen necklace of your owner, Mari. On the adventure, you'll meet curious characters from the wilderness and the streets.<br>Discover the secrets of Soup Town, Toome Hill and Tartu.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2877550/extras/2b130c8a88bc25e5278a008583be3ae2.poster.avif?t=1714388236\" width=640 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2877550/extras/2b130c8a88bc25e5278a008583be3ae2.webm?t=1714388236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2877550/extras/2b130c8a88bc25e5278a008583be3ae2.mp4?t=1714388236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>SOUPTOWN:<br><br><i>&quot;SUPILINN, OR SOUP TOWN OF Tartu, is one of the last historic 19th-century slums surviving in Europe. The neighborhood sprang up around a beer brewery on the bank of the Emaj\u00f5gi River. The low-lying riverbank was a swamp, flooded each year by the river. Cheap land attracted large masses of poor brewery workers who built a maze of wooden houses, muddy streets, and small gardens.<br><br>The names of the streets, such as Kartuli (Potato), Herne (Pea), Oa (Bean), Marja (Berry), and Meloni (Melon), gave the name of Supilinn (Soup Town) to the district.&quot; </i> Atlas Obscura<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2877550/extras/5bdb2c7c6e61f625b7618b314e1a4805.poster.avif?t=1714388236\" width=640 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2877550/extras/5bdb2c7c6e61f625b7618b314e1a4805.webm?t=1714388236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2877550/extras/5bdb2c7c6e61f625b7618b314e1a4805.mp4?t=1714388236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><strong>Alfa demo is currently available. Give it a go and leave some feedback.<br>Thank you!</strong><br><br>Future plans for the full game:<br>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0- Sniffing mechanism for clues and hints.<br>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0- Somewhere between 10 or 12 levels.<br>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0- More interactable objects and characters.<br>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0- Save mechanism with peeing on the light poles on the street.<br>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0- Full sound design and soundtrack to amplify the atmosphere.<br><br>Meanwhile you can proceed with smashing pumpkins.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2877550/extras/b10ddbce9ceaa6bc5cbccc9f70aaa3d3.poster.avif?t=1714388236\" width=640 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2877550/extras/b10ddbce9ceaa6bc5cbccc9f70aaa3d3.webm?t=1714388236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2877550/extras/b10ddbce9ceaa6bc5cbccc9f70aaa3d3.mp4?t=1714388236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "MATTY:<br>You play as Matty, the French bulldog, who lives in a place called Soup Town in Tartu, Estonia.<br>You have to find the stolen necklace of your owner, Mari. On the adventure, you'll meet curious characters from the wilderness and the streets.<br>Discover the secrets of Soup Town, Toome Hill and Tartu.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2877550/extras/2b130c8a88bc25e5278a008583be3ae2.poster.avif?t=1714388236\" width=640 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2877550/extras/2b130c8a88bc25e5278a008583be3ae2.webm?t=1714388236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2877550/extras/2b130c8a88bc25e5278a008583be3ae2.mp4?t=1714388236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>SOUPTOWN:<br><br><i>&quot;SUPILINN, OR SOUP TOWN OF Tartu, is one of the last historic 19th-century slums surviving in Europe. The neighborhood sprang up around a beer brewery on the bank of the Emaj\u00f5gi River. The low-lying riverbank was a swamp, flooded each year by the river. Cheap land attracted large masses of poor brewery workers who built a maze of wooden houses, muddy streets, and small gardens.<br><br>The names of the streets, such as Kartuli (Potato), Herne (Pea), Oa (Bean), Marja (Berry), and Meloni (Melon), gave the name of Supilinn (Soup Town) to the district.&quot; </i> Atlas Obscura<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2877550/extras/5bdb2c7c6e61f625b7618b314e1a4805.poster.avif?t=1714388236\" width=640 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2877550/extras/5bdb2c7c6e61f625b7618b314e1a4805.webm?t=1714388236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2877550/extras/5bdb2c7c6e61f625b7618b314e1a4805.mp4?t=1714388236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><strong>Alfa demo is currently available. Give it a go and leave some feedback.<br>Thank you!</strong><br><br>Future plans for the full game:<br>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0- Sniffing mechanism for clues and hints.<br>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0- Somewhere between 10 or 12 levels.<br>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0- More interactable objects and characters.<br>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0- Save mechanism with peeing on the light poles on the street.<br>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0- Full sound design and soundtrack to amplify the atmosphere.<br><br>Meanwhile you can proceed with smashing pumpkins.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2877550/extras/b10ddbce9ceaa6bc5cbccc9f70aaa3d3.poster.avif?t=1714388236\" width=640 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2877550/extras/b10ddbce9ceaa6bc5cbccc9f70aaa3d3.webm?t=1714388236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2877550/extras/b10ddbce9ceaa6bc5cbccc9f70aaa3d3.mp4?t=1714388236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "short_description": "Souptown Matty is a story-based mystery-solving dog simulator. Around the time when spirits linger, an unexpected visitor comes and steals your owner's beloved necklace. It's time to take action on your own and start investigating.",
